WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:05.790
Transform!

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:08.670
Let's join him!

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:09.580
Stay back!

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.380
Hey, big lug!

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:29.710
Kakeru!

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.330
Ibara...?

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:43.040
Ibara!

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.790
"I just don't care anymore"

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.580
A reply thrown out

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:17.380
Briefly blooming then briefly falling, over and over

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.920
Left feeling unsatisfied

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:23.830
Yes, day by day, I walked on

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:26.130
Cry, futurity, gloomy

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:30.130
The twilight still out of reach

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:32.500
Don't lose your way

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.670
Tighten the twine of dreams

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.080
Take me so high

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:40.920
Start running to a brand new life

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.420
Everything I have in my hand

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:47.130
Holding onto seven colors

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:49.000
Go ahead, make my day

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.380
I'll use this fist to rebel even harder!

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.830
Everything I have in my hand

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:58.580
Sketching ideals and hopes

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.170
I won't let you down

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:03.460
I'll let this flower bloom forever!

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:07.130
Believe myself

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:19.040
<b>Escape</b>

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:39.790
Father?!

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.330
Just how damn weak do you have to be...

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.920
to gang up on a single young lady?

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.420
Enju Myojin...

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:57.540
Surrender the Shrine Maiden.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.080
Not on your life.

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.670
What the heck was I just dreaming about...?

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:31.630
Where am I?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:35.750
Ibara...

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:37.710
Kakeru! Are you okay?

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:38.330
Huh?

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:41.170
Oh, yeah. I'm doing fine.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:42.540
The armor must have done it's job.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:44.880
Or maybe he saved me...

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:46.750
That's a relief.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.790
Anyway, we have a problem.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.880
Our base in city hall... has been swallowed
by the nether realm.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.170
They've come to hit us where it counts.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.170
Ukon! Issa!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:03:59.830
Ma'am!

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.250
We'll come with you!

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:07.960
Me too!

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:14.250
Kakeru, please stay by Lady Oka's side.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:16.500
All right.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:22.330
Kaede!

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:24.670
I'm fine! Go help Ryo instead!

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:28.710
It's going to be okay.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:31.000
Just have faith that they'll all come back.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:32.880
Right.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:38.290
Whenever we went out to fight... you were always
waiting and hoping that we'd come back safe, huh?

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:42.710
That's right. I was just doing whatever I could.

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:45.580
Oka!

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:52.170
You gotta wake up, Ibara!

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:53.880
I really need your help here!

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.250
Big sis!

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.500
I will keep Oka safe!

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:05.790
No matter what it takes.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.040
Something's been bothering me.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:15.670
This attack made it seem like
the Oni had a distinct purpose.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.880
What do you mean by that?

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:22.330
All of these Oni were organized and
clearly working together to target Oka.

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:24.880
I see.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.170
And what of Ibara?

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.210
Ibara? Why do you ask?

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:30.960
He remains MIA, sir.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:35.630
But he was an irregular presence to begin with.
There should be no impact on our operations.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:37.460
I see.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:48.500
The Shikizakura trees...

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:49.920
are blooming.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.880
The time has come.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.500
We shall commence the ritual tomorrow.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.380
Tomorrow?!

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:57.670
You can't...

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.330
That's too soon!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.960
We no longer have any time to waste.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:04.420
If Oka falls into the hands of the Oni,

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.630
our entire world will be swallowed up.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:09.830
Understood, sir.

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:13.000
<b>NAGOYA CITY HALL</b>

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:13.000
<b>CONSULTATION OFFICE</b>

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:16.830
People are reporting more unlawful dumping.
It's that weird stone again.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.000
What do you think it is?

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:21.880
A strange animal, you say? Larger than a raccoon?

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:23.750
Uh, okay...

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:26.750
We're reorganizing things.

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:30.380
Midnight Sun, or White Team,
is officially disbanded as of now.

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:31.670
But why?!

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.290
At least give us some warning...

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:38.960
Our war with the Oni has reached the final stages.
We can't afford to be playing around anymore.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.670
Are you okay with this, Princess?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:49.790
Thank you, everyone. I appreciate you playing
along with my selfish demands up until now.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:53.290
Ryo.

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:55.580
You move under my command now.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:56.880
Roger that.

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:58.500
I want to help out, too!

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.460
I'm not ready to give up on being a hero just yet.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:03.580
Having someone who can fly will help.

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:04.420
You're in.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:05.790
Hooray!

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.210
Okay. Then I'll join, too.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:10.880
We don't need you. You're a burden.

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:12.000
What?

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.130
Come on, Ms. Benio. That's rude.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.790
Well then, how about I adopt the little kitten instead?

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.080
You need to watch your mouth, too. Got it?

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.290
Oka.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.000
I need to speak with you later.

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:35.920
Very well then.

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.040
Oka...

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:41.670
I've been prepared for this for a long time.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.080
I'm happy if it can stop the fighting.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.790
You're a tough girl... aren't you, Oka?

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.920
We're leaving for Obara tonight.
Make sure you're ready to go.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:56.580
Will do.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:13.210
Why did you volunteer?

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:15.250
What, I'm just supposed to sit and watch?

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:17.130
You know that I can fight!

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.330
Sorry. That's not what I meant.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:21.500
It's just that...

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:24.250
I don't want you to push yourself.

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:25.040
Huh?

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:26.830
Since when are you so caring?

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.880
I wanna stay in the fight for those who can't anymore.

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:34.920
That's my motivation. We've gotta do this for them!

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:38.710
You're right.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.330
You already quit once.
And you really should keep it that way.

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:55.250
Here you go.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:00.500
I hope you're not letting idle thoughts
get the better of you.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.250
What does that mean?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:06.580
We have a duty to uphold,
no matter what sacrifices are made.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:10.920
This is something that has been
repeated since time immemorial.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:13.040
I know that.

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.250
It reeks. Reeks to high heaven.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.130
This is the scent of a Shrine Maiden!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:29.630
Huh?

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:36.630
So you're the one! Everyone's been talking
about an Oni rampaging through these parts.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.250
You'll regret it if you think I'm anything like the other Oni.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:42.330
Because my name is...

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.380
the great Ibara!

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:49.790
Hey, Shrine Maiden! I'm gonna eat ya, so get in my belly!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.830
You're going to eat the girl who dispels Oni?

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:55.130
Just come up here and try it, I dare you!

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.460
I was hoping you'd say that.

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:02.580
All I have to do is eat you and...

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.830
then I have nothing to fear in this world!

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.170
What the hell?

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.670
I can't see anything!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.960
What did you bastards do?!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:20.830
Oh shit! This can't be happening!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:26.170
Lord Enju?!

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:28.500
You're trapped now, Ibara.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.670
Did you seriously just eat me?!

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.630
That's not how this works!

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:33.250
Chisato.

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:35.880
Cook us something to eat, would you?

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.420
Huh?

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:40.880
If you're so damn hungry...

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:44.130
then try eating something with more flavor than humans!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.880
That's good!

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:00.920
<b>Kinshachi Yokocho</b>

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.210
I must be sleep deprived...

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>Dude!  We totally need</b>

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>to go to Port Messe. There's</b>

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>an event being held there!</b>

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>I'm down (^ ^)!</b>

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>From what I hear,  they're</b>

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>having a stage show this time!</b>

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>Hot damn!</b>

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>Whoa...</b>

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>Where are you?</b>

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:03.210
<b>Can you get the day off?</b>

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>Whoa...</b>

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>Can you get the day off?</b>

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>Where are you?</b>

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>Is it your job? It's getting pretty</b>

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>late, dude. Everything okay?</b>

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>CHAMP on your way home?</b>

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>I think I'm getting fired.</b>

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>Congrats! Mind picking</b>

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.040
<b>up the newest issue of</b>

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:05.540
Is that you Oka?

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:10.460
We need to go now.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:14.960
Oka?

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:19.880
<b>Please forgive me</b>

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:19.880
<b>From Oka</b>

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.130
Oka?!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.210
Shikizakura.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:32.080
Shikizakura!

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.580
Right this way, little miss.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:39.830
This is the...

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:42.460
My father used to be the curator here.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.250
Do you mind joining me?

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:47.130
There's something that I want you to know,

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:51.330
before the Shikizakura ritual gets started. Okay?

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.500
<b>Nagoya City Museum</b>

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.670
My ancestors were collectors of
many documents relating to the Oni.

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.920
Of course, I never realized
they had stored Ibara here, too.

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:06.710
Why do you think the Oni appear from the nether realm?

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.380
I don't know. The Oni don't interest me.

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:12.420
They come here to grant people's wishes.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.670
People's greed is what attracts them.

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:19.080
But even if their wish is granted they still get eaten.

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:21.130
Isn't that right?

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.880
Exactly. Then they become a Shinja.

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:29.580
Pop quiz. Let's say that if an Oni possessed
a person whose wish could not be granted...

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:31.250
what do you think happens then?

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:34.500
I told you, I don't know! What are you getting at?

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.580
Why bother telling me any of this?

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:41.330
Because you and I are very similar...

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.790
We both lost the right to be heroes.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.210
Am I right?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.710
Obara Village.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.380
<b>Spectacular Sight</b>

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.380
<b>Obara's Shikizakura Trees in Bloom!</b>

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.380
<b>Harmony with the Fall Colors</b>

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.380
<b>Toyota City, Obara District</b>

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:59.540
That's a trip down memory lane...

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.330
Why're you wasting your time on that crap?

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:07.880
Interesting question.

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:11.790
I've got one for you.
Why are you so bent on eating humans?

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.880
Because Oni get stronger by feasting upon humans.

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:18.040
And what will you do after you become stronger?

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:21.500
I'll get stronger... and then I'll...

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:24.000
I dunno, I just need to be strong!

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:28.250
That seems like a waste.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:29.830
Huh?

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.000
I cannot live for very long.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:35.420
And I won't have any children, either.

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:38.920
It doesn't matter what you do or how long you live.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:42.250
We're all going to die in the end
and that makes everything pointless.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:44.830
There's no meaning to life at all, if you ask me.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.000
I'm planting this cherry blossom tree now because

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:52.210
I know that people will smile and
enjoy its beauty someday in the future.

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:55.210
And the thought of that makes me happy!

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.380
Thank you, Ibara.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:08.960
It ain't me doing it. Enju's the one who wanted to help.

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:11.710
Whatever you say.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.000
Look at that!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:19.830
It feels great up here!

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:22.000
I'm so glad the weather is nice today!

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:25.500
This is the first time I've seen anybody
so excited about a TV tower...

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.000
What?

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:56.750
You cannot interfere, Ibara!

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:00.750
This is something that must be done...
in order to save our world.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.630
That's a load of bullshit!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.710
How can you be okay with any of this?!

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:09.330
Just look! Your own daughter
is going to sacrifice her life!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.170
I do not mind.

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:15.380
I have been prepared to face my death...

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:18.080
for many ages now.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:24.500
Hey Oka?

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:26.830
Listen, Kakeru...

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:30.080
I've been keeping a big secret from you.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:32.830
It's about the Shikizakura ritual.

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:36.420
It requires you to sacrifice your life, doesn't it?

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:39.080
You knew?

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:40.790
That's insane...

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:43.830
The ritual will be held tomorrow.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.250
Tomorrow?!

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:46.330
Yes!

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:48.920
That's why I'm going to have all sorts of fun today!

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.670
But I guess there's not enough time to go see the ocean.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:59.500
Do you remember? The time that
we all went to the beach?

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:01.380
That was so much fun.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.290
Let's go there! Right now!

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:07.540
Okay!

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:14.080
Every light that we see out
there is someone's house, huh?

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:19.460
Everyone has their own life and their own family.

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:21.920
They have both good times and bad times.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:27.080
If given the chance... to protect all
of the lights out there, then I...

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.380
<b>Missed Call From Kippei</b>

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.380
<b>Missed Call From Benio</b>

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.380
<b>Missed Call From Benio</b>

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.380
<b>Missed Call From Benio</b>

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.380
<b>Missed Call From Kippei</b>

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.380
<b>Missed Call From Benio</b>

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.380
<b>Missed Call From Benio</b>

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.380
<b>Missed Call From Benio</b>

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:35.420
Damn that little hell-spawn..

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:40.330
It got dark fast, huh?

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:44.710
I can't see it now, but I can still smell the ocean.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:48.250
<b>Guesthouse</b>

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:48.250
<b>Matsuhikoso</b>

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:47.790
Excuse me...

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.080
Do you have any rooms available?

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:52.630
Well, sure we do, but...

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:55.040
You two look like you're in high school.

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:57.750
Just let 'em stay the night, Mom!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.670
Huh?

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:03.380
We got the space! If you're worried,
let's just say they're friends of mine!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:04.630
Okay?

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.750
I'm afraid we don't offer any diner service.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.460
Thank you very much!

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.830
Y'know, looking at you brings back memories!

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:15.710
You're just like me when I was a kid!

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:16.920
Huh?

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:22.920
It's funny, Kakeru. So many curious
people take a liking to you.

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:26.330
Like the people from the hero show, and even Ibarbie!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:27.920
That's for sure...

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:31.460
I wonder if you'll grow up to be similar to that man.

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:32.830
Nope, no way.

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.540
Just you wait and see!

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:37.710
I'm not sure how, but... I'll turn into someone amazing!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.380
I would've liked to see how the future you turned out.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.380
You know, I've never been on a field trip before!

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.630
So actually, this is my first time in a guesthouse!

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:55.500
And there's only one thing to do when you stay the night!

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:00.580
Wow, that was just as great as I imagined!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.330
Chowing down on some premium
ice cream really is the best!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:09.000
It's a dream come true!
I've always wanted to try "room service"!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:12.880
Well, I just ran to the convenience store,
so it's not exactly real room service...

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:15.540
So hey!

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:17.580
Let's make more of your dreams come true!

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:20.330
You still have some left unfulfilled right?

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:22.790
Yes, I do.

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:26.540
I want to go overseas and partake in authentic pizza!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.380
Pizza! That's a great idea!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:33.750
I also want to attend the famous summer
sumo tournament and try raising an extra fluffy dog!

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:36.920
I used to have a lot of dreams like that.

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:42.130
Like falling in love, getting married, and doing
the traditional snack-scattering from the rooftop.

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:46.460
What sort of dreams do you have, Kakeru?
I'd love to hear them.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:53.250
Well... since I was a little kid I never spent
my birthday money and just saved it all up instead.

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:57.130
Actually, I didn't really have a choice...

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:01.830
But after I entered high school, my auntie gave me
the bank card and told me to use it how I wanted.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:04.130
And so...?

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.920
What I'm saying is, just leave it to me!

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:08.790
I can keep doing this for a long time!

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:12.880
Pizza, sumo tournaments, you name it!
We can have all sorts of fun!

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.210
That's my dream right now! To help you with-

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:18.380
I'm sorry.

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:25.920
The connection between our world and the nether realm
must be severed. Otherwise, many people will perish.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:29.830
I've figured it all out already.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:33.380
That my destiny is to be the one
who protects the dreams of other people.

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.330
I've made up my mind.

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:37.790
You're making a big mistake!

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:41.540
Even if it means saving everyone else,
you can't sacrifice yourself!

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:44.540
Please, Oka!

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:50.330
The Myojin family has performed this ritual over
and over again for many centuries.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:54.170
I knew what would happen from the moment
the mark of the Shrine Maiden appeared on me.

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:59.460
Even if I were to run from the ritual itself,
I can never escape from this mark upon my body.

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:03.170
My life will end... one way or the other.

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:07.790
So please, I don't want you to feel obligated to help me.

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.000
But that's awful!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.670
I want you to keep on living, Kakeru.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:17.540
Not for the sake of someone like me, but for yourself.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:21.630
Please just move on...
and erase me from your memories.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:28.670
I'll never forget you. I'll always remember!

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:34.500
Eight years ago, my life was saved by someone.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:39.040
And that person... she was your mother, wasn't she?

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:44.250
Then after I met you, I learned the reason why I survived.

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:46.630
I'm going to become a hero.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:50.420
And then... I'll find a way to save your life!

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:13.420
I hope that this moment never ends

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:17.420
I hope that it continues for decades to come

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:23.830
Becoming unable to even wear pretty outfits

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:28.210
In a world where only I have passed on

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:32.380
The cider I disliked that day

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:34.580
The cry of the missing cicadas

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.920
Drowning into fate

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:39.960
Not knowing how to struggle

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:44.790
It's almost as if I'm invisible to everyone

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:48.670
I don't even feel the urge to resist

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:54.380
After you helped pulled me along

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:58.250
I saw the beautiful colors of the world

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.880
In the season of blooming cherry blossoms

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:05.040
Captivated by that innocent smile

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:09.080
There is nothing that can't be changed

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:13.080
And that's true of any sad future too, right?

00:22:25.330 --> 00:22:26.710
Kakeru Miwa!

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:30.710
You're never going to see the sunrise again!

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:37.500
Hey, Ibara.

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:37.880
Huh?

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:39.040
Do I really smell that bad?

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:40.750
Wh-what kind of question is that?!

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.670
Well, you kept saying the Shrine Maiden reeked...

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:45.130
Oh, but that's just, you know... an instinctual thing!

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Determination</b>

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:47.880
Next time: Determination

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:49.210
Don't worry, you smell just fine.

00:22:49.210 --> 00:22:50.250
That's a relief!
